Z||000000||whamel||09-19-2000||04:22 PM||||Okay - I've been putting together a database of specs of all the years of Fieros (hp, weight, size, etc.) for the Palm pilot so I can have them handy whenever I need them or I'm at a show and get curious.  I thought this might be pretty handy for me, but then I was thinking that anybody with a palm pilot might want to take a look at it.  I'll put it up on my web site (www.geocities.com/whamel - then head to my Fiero page) on Monday so I can get some input or error correction or whatever if you're interested, but I thought this might be useful to some folks.  Go there next week if you're interested in taking a look - I'd appreciate any input, corrections, or constructive criticism.  There's only so much I can do with this program, but I'll try to incorporate what I can.<BR>By the way, I've stuck a few other cars in there for comparison as well so you can get a little heads up when looking at the competition as well.  I thought that might be handy too.<BR>Thanks,<BR>Wade<BR>P.S. There are a couple programs you can use to view this database (in MobileDB format) on the PC if you're interested.  I'll have links to them as well.||||reg||6
